  "title": "Slow Cooker Sweet-and-Sour Pot Roast",
  "description": "Perfectly tender slow cooker pot roast with a delicious sweet-and-sour sauce made with brown sugar, tomato sauce, and vinegar. This recipe is a favorite.",
